<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 326 AND 74-0; PAKISTAN 521-8 DECLARED.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 326 AND 74-0; PAKISTAN 521-8 DECLARED.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 74 for no wicket in</p>
<p>their second innings at the close of the fourth day of the third</p>
<p>and final test at The Oval on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: England 326 and 74-0; Pakistan 521-8 declared.</p>
</text>
